%% M² sequence: reading a recorded clip (clip mode)
sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant R as Renderer (app.js, clip.js)
  participant M as Main process (main.cjs)
  participant C as Reader child process
  participant P as Presage SDK and cloud
  U->>R: Tap Read me
  R->>R: Record about 60 s with MediaRecorder
  R->>M: clip:read (clip data, extension)
  M->>M: Write temp file m2-clip-* (mode 0600)
  M->>C: Start reader (key by environment)
  C->>P: useFile, start (key check, model download)
  P-->>C: metrics (breathing, pulse, HRV, expression)
  C-->>M: progress lines, then done summary
  M->>M: Delete temp file
  M-->>R: Summary and picture checks
  R->>R: ClipSource.setReading, score tension
  R-->>U: Plain-words result and next step
